{"sourceUrl":"https://stat.bnu.edu.cn/tzgg4/8ffe5b16dd8b401d88c4ea7a554bdf54.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:58.675778+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://stat.bnu.edu.cn/tzgg4/8ffe5b16dd8b401d88c4ea7a554bdf54.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>北京师范大学统计学院</span><span>接收</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生</span><span>工作</span><span>，</span><span>将</span><span>于2025年</span><span>9月17日至9月19日</span><span>（周三至周五）</span><span>，</span><span>在北京</span><span>校区</span><span>线下</span><span>组织开展</span><span>。本次</span><span>活动</span><span>拟</span><span>招收</span><span>应用统计专业硕士生、统计学学术硕士生</span><span>和</span><span>直博生</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>一、遴选方式</span></p>\n<p><span>申请人需在</span><span>2025年9月1</span><span>1</span><span>日（周</span><span>四</span><span>）</span><span>上午10:00</span><span>前</span><span>，</span><span>在</span><span>我校</span><span>推免申请</span><span>系统</span><span>（</span><a href=\"https://yzh.bnu.edu.cn/www/tm/xs/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yzh.bnu.edu.cn/www/tm/xs/login</span></a><span>）</span><span>进行网上申请，上</span><span>传规定</span><span>的材料，下载并填写相关表格。</span></p>\n<p><span>申请</span><span>所需电子材料，</span><span>详见</span><span>《北京师范大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收校内外推荐免试硕士</span><span>/</span><span>博士研究生办法》</span><span>（</span><a href=\"https://yz.bnu.edu.cn/detail/010488a9-2a7d-4905-86fc-4afadc0ad2a2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yz.bnu.edu.cn/detail/010488a9-2a7d-4905-86fc-4afadc0ad2a</span><span>2</span></a><span>）。</span><span>无需寄送纸质版材料，纸质</span><span>版材料</span><span>在复试时提交学院审核备案。</span></p>\n<p><span>材料审核后，学院会在</span><span>2025年9月14日（周日）</span><span>下午17:00</span><span>前</span><span>电话通知入选者本人。</span><span>届时未</span><span>接到通知的同学表明未能入选，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p>\n<p><span>【请注意】</span><span>考生填报</span><span>推免系统</span><span>时，</span><span>请按照学校</span><span>研招网</span><span>招生专业目录</span><span>，</span><span>在“申请专业方向”里填写清楚研究方向，后续学院将根据方向志愿优先录取。</span></p>\n<p><span>025200应用统计</span><span>研究方向</span><span>包括</span><span>：</span></p>\n<p><span>01经济与金融统计（珠海）</span></p>\n<p><span>02数据科学与管理（珠海）</span></p>\n<p><span>03教育测量与大数据挖掘（珠海）</span></p>\n<p><span>071400统计学</span><span>研究方向</span><span>包括</span><span>：</span></p>\n<p><span>01经济统计学(珠海)</span></p>\n<p><span>02统计理论及应用(珠海)</span></p>\n<p><span>0714Z1经济统计学</span><span>研究方向</span><span>包括</span><span>：</span></p>\n<p><span>01国民经济核算</span></p>\n<p><span>02宏观经济统计分析</span></p>\n<p><span>03宏观经济统计分析(珠海)</span></p>\n<p><span>0714Z2应用统计</span><span>研究方向</span><span>包括</span><span>：</span></p>\n<p><span>01应用统计</span></p>\n<p><span>02应用统计(珠海)</span></p>\n<p><span>二、活动安排</span></p>\n<p><span>活动期间</span><span>，</span><span>将</span><span>组织</span><span>介绍</span><span>北京师范大学</span><span>统计学科</span><span>发展</span><span>及</span><span>培养</span><span>情况</span><span>，</span><span>并组织</span><span>开展笔试、面试等</span><span>综合考核</span><span>。具体日程及安排</span><span>将</span><span>后续通知</span><span>，</span><span>请保持关注。</span></p>\n<p><span>活动期间统一安排校内午餐与晚餐，</span><span>入选</span><span>同学的住宿费用和交通费用需自行承担。</span></p>\n<p><span>本院为经济困难学生提供300元/人的报销额度，需提交证明和相应火车票作为报销凭据，并提供身份证复印件及个人有效银行卡号。</span></p>\n<p><span>三、联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span>联系人：马老师</span></p>\n<p><span>联系电话：010-58800136</span></p>\n<p><span>电子邮件：maying@bnu.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>6级</span><span>北师大统计</span><span>学院推免招生</span><span>QQ群：760791790</span></p>\n<p><span>地址：北京市海淀区新街口外大街5号院（原城乡一建）统计学院办公楼一楼110室，邮编100875</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"62fa94ff33521e67172867edbf971839c3171f78aceb4aa603eefa7448450c08","textLength":961,"sourceSha256":"4e614077c9a60c6ddf88205aabeee68813183f11363fac82dd603bb8af9682db","selector":"article-like:gp-article gp-f16","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9dbc884a4f04afe95e04","title":"2025年北京师范大学统计学院“全国统计学优秀大学生学术提升营”活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:58.675778+00:00"}
